{"seq":2,"slug":"data-science","title":"数据科学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数据科学-简介\">数据科学 简介</h1><p>数据科学是从数据中提取知识和洞察的系统方法。它融合了统计学的推断能力、计算机科学的处理能力和领域知识的解释能力，帮助人们在海量、嘈杂、不完美的数据中发现有价值的模式。从电商平台的推荐算法到公共卫生的疫情预测，数据科学正在重塑决策的方式。</p>\n<p>这门学科对自学者的吸引力在于它极强的实践性。你不需要等到学完所有理论才能开始分析数据——找一个感兴趣的数据集，提出一个好问题，然后用你目前掌握的工具去探索，就是最好的学习方式。当然，随着问题的深入，你会自然地发现统计方法和工程能力的不足，这时再有针对性地补充，学习效率最高。</p>\n<p>本学习空间将数据科学的核心知识组织为四个章节。<strong>第一章 数据科学基础</strong> 涵盖数据采集与清洗、探索性数据分析和数据伦理，帮助你建立处理真实数据的基本素养。<strong>第二章 统计建模</strong> 介绍回归模型、分类方法和贝叶斯统计，这些是从数据中做推断的核心工具。<strong>第三章 大数据工程</strong> 关注当数据规模超出单机处理能力时需要的技术方案，包括分布式系统基础、数据管道设计和流处理。<strong>第四章 数据应用</strong> 展示数据科学在实际场景中的落地方式，涵盖推荐系统、A/B 测试方法和地理空间分析。</p>\n<p>建议先从第一章开始动手操作真实数据，建立对&quot;数据长什么样&quot;的直觉。统计建模和大数据工程可以根据自己的背景灵活选择先后顺序——统计功底强的人可以先攻工程，编程功底强的人可以先补统计。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-fundamentals","title":"数据科学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/data-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-types-collection","title":"数据科学 — 数据类型与采集","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/data-fundamentals/data-types-collection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-cleaning-preprocessing","title":"数据科学 — 数据清洗与预处理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/data-fundamentals/data-cleaning-preprocessing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"exploratory-data-analysis","title":"数据科学 — 探索性数据分析（EDA）","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/data-fundamentals/exploratory-data-analysis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"statistical-modeling","title":"统计建模","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/statistical-modeling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"regression-analysis","title":"大学数据科学 — 回归分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/statistical-modeling/regression-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"classification-clustering","title":"大学数据科学 — 分类与聚类","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/statistical-modeling/classification-clustering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"time-series-analysis","title":"大学数据科学 — 时间序列分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/statistical-modeling/time-series-analysis"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"big-data-engineering","title":"大数据工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/big-data-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"distributed-computing","title":"分布式计算框架","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/big-data-engineering/distributed-computing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-storage-systems","title":"数据存储系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/big-data-engineering/data-storage-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-pipeline-orchestration","title":"数据管道与编排","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/big-data-engineering/data-pipeline-orchestration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-applications","title":"数据应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/data-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"business-analytics","title":"商业数据分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/data-applications/business-analytics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-visualization-storytelling","title":"数据可视化与叙事","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/data-applications/data-visualization-storytelling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mlops-deployment","title":"MLOps 与模型部署","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/data-science/data-applications/mlops-deployment"}]}]}